<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-SPC half year net slides 22 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-SPC half year net slides 22 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     1.91 vs   2.92</p>
<p>    Net					1.61 vs   2.07</p>
<p>    Sales				   85.89 vs  79.10</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (cents)	   0.5  vs   1.0</p>
<p>Note: SPC Ltd is a fruit and vegetable canner. It said it was confident of an improved performance for the full year.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
